<title>USA: Thermo to buy up to $5 mln of unit's stock.</title>
<headline>Thermo to buy up to $5 mln of unit's stock.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thermo Fibertek Inc said Wednesday its board of directors has authorized the repurchase through March 19, 1998 of up to $5 million of securities of its Thermo Fibergen subsidiary in the open market, or in negotiated transactions.</p>
<p>Thermo Fibertek said it will repurchase these securities when they are available at prices the company considers attractive.</p>
<p>Thermo Fibertek makes and sells products for the papermaking and paper-recycling industries.</p>
